1
00:00:12,119 --> 00:00:14,839
Listen up, everyone. Our guild master's having a big birthday,

2
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,199
and we need some extra hands.

3
00:00:16,559 --> 00:00:17,480
If you make the cut,

4
00:00:17,679 --> 00:00:19,120
you get three silver dollars upfront.

5
00:00:19,879 --> 00:00:21,120
Who's up for it?

6
00:00:21,719 --> 00:00:24,000
Me! Me! Me!

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,800
All right. The Shipboard Guild won't take trash.

8
00:00:27,079 --> 00:00:28,559
What skills do you have?

9
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,880
I know some martial arts.

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Come on, let's spar.

11
00:01:05,799 --> 00:01:08,000
Boss Ma, your skills are formidable.

12
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:09,799
I pale in comparison.

13
00:01:09,959 --> 00:01:13,200
Good, good, good!

14
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:15,640
What's your name?

15
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:17,400
A-Liang.

16
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:20,280
Alright. Starting today,

17
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:22,920
A-Liang is a member of our Shipboard Guild.

18
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,719
Thank you, Boss Ma!

19
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:37,640
Starting today,

20
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:39,519
stop all investigations into

21
00:01:39,519 --> 00:01:40,439
the Bai Yumei and Liu Furong case.

22
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:41,719
Why?

23
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:43,439
We've already confirmed

24
00:01:43,439 --> 00:01:44,799
the killer is from the Shipboard Guild.

25
00:01:45,079 --> 00:01:47,040
They've been hunting down the prostitutes from Minchun Pavilion.

26
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,120
There must be

27
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,319
some dark secret behind this.

28
00:01:49,439 --> 00:01:51,040
It's just an ordinary murder case.

29
00:01:51,400 --> 00:01:52,920
There's no need to waste police resources.

30
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:55,079
I thought

31
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:58,120
things would be different with a new deputy chief.

32
00:01:58,959 --> 00:01:59,760
I never imagined...

33
00:02:00,879 --> 00:02:02,879
I never thought all cops were the same.

34
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,039
Come in.

35
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:26,199
What's wrong?

36
00:02:28,759 --> 00:02:31,000
My mom won't let me work here anymore.

37
00:02:31,319 --> 00:02:32,000
She said...

38
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,479
Said what?

39
00:02:35,479 --> 00:02:37,639
That no one at the station is any good.

40
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:41,919
Get out.

41
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:07,000
There are many VIPs at the boss's banquet.

42
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,759
You guys keep your eyes peeled.

43
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,080
Don't let anything go wrong.

44
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,000
Yes, sir!

45
00:03:15,759 --> 00:03:16,439
Boss Chen!

46
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:17,800
Welcome!

47
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:21,520
A-Liang, show Boss Chen the way.

48
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:24,439
Boss Chen,

49
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:25,680
right this way.

50
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,319
Watch your step.

51
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:43,960
Stop right there.

52
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:48,400
Turn around.

53
00:03:54,879 --> 00:03:55,560
Come here.

54
00:04:01,919 --> 00:04:03,039
Just because I turned you down,

55
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,479
you're mad at me?

56
00:04:10,879 --> 00:04:11,840
I came prepared.

57
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:12,919
I wore a bulletproof vest.

58
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,719
Li Mingyuan is a great shot.

59
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,639
He made sure to avoid my vitals.

60
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,000
This is a map of the Sun estate.

61
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,879
It shows where Xu Qiushuang

62
00:04:22,879 --> 00:04:23,920
and Huang Haitang are held.

63
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,160
Don't worry.

64
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,519
What I promised you,

65
00:04:30,639 --> 00:04:31,519
I'll see it through.

66
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:33,959
Stay safe.

67
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:39,759
President Sun,

68
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:41,319
congratulations.

69
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:42,199
Brother Li.

70
00:04:55,399 --> 00:04:56,040
Everyone,

71
00:04:57,079 --> 00:04:58,879
today is my birthday banquet.

72
00:04:59,439 --> 00:05:02,319
Thank you all for taking the time to join me.

73
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:03,839
Cheers!

74
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:05,759
Cheers!

75
00:05:11,079 --> 00:05:13,879
Everyone, Director Li here

76
00:05:14,519 --> 00:05:16,720
is Sun Hanji's sworn brother.

77
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,079
If any of you ever need help,

78
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:18,920
going to him

79
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,759
is just like coming to me.

80
00:05:21,199 --> 00:05:21,879
Understood?

81
00:05:22,319 --> 00:05:28,600
Good, good, good!

82
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,639
Brother Li, please.

83
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:46,480
Follow me. I'll introduce you to a VIP.

84
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,399
Mr. Matsui.

85
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,319
This is Director Li.

86
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,759
He's my sworn brother.

87
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:59,240
And this is the president of the

88
00:05:59,519 --> 00:06:00,319
Matsui Trading Company, Mr. Matsui.

89
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:03,480
Mr. Matsui, a pleasure to meet you.

90
00:06:04,079 --> 00:06:05,439
Director Li is young and promising.

91
00:06:06,399 --> 00:06:08,079
I look forward to working closely with you.

92
00:06:08,319 --> 00:06:08,839
Of course.

93
00:06:09,959 --> 00:06:10,600
Cheers.

94
00:06:19,439 --> 00:06:20,680
After you, Mr. Matsui.

95
00:06:21,759 --> 00:06:22,439
I'll take my leave.

96
00:06:24,879 --> 00:06:27,360
Brother Li, your presence here today

97
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:29,240
is truly an honor for me.

98
00:06:29,879 --> 00:06:30,439
I...

99
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:33,519
...prepared a special gift for you.

100
00:06:37,879 --> 00:06:39,399
They hid the Coastal Defense Map.

101
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,519
They won't hand it over, no matter what.

102
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:45,079
Today, I'll make them cough it all up.

103
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,600
Such a pretty face.

104
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:01,560
Wouldn't it be a shame to ruin it?

105
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:02,800
Are you going to talk?

106
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:05,680
I...

107
00:07:06,079 --> 00:07:07,680
I don't know!

108
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:08,600
You don't know?

109
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:13,240
President, torturing them like this,

110
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:14,839
they won't say a word.

111
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,240
Brother Li,

112
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,519
what do you suggest?

113
00:07:41,279 --> 00:07:42,759
If you don't talk,

114
00:07:43,519 --> 00:07:45,040
she'll suffer in your place.

115
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,160
Where is the Coastal Defense Map?

116
00:07:58,759 --> 00:08:00,600
Qiushuang, don't talk! I'm not afraid!

117
00:08:03,839 --> 00:08:06,120
I'll talk! I'll talk! Don't touch her!

118
00:08:08,399 --> 00:08:09,120
Where is it?

119
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:14,480
Under the banyan tree on Changning Road.

120
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,480
Will you talk?

121
00:08:27,399 --> 00:08:29,000
Three Lanes and Seven Alleys, Nanhou St.

122
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,399
Inside the Fu Lu Shou Xi carving's base.

123
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,840
Brother Li,

124
00:08:36,519 --> 00:08:38,600
you're truly a master of interrogation.

125
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:41,080
Without breaking a sweat,

126
00:08:41,759 --> 00:08:43,279
you made them both confess.

127
00:08:43,679 --> 00:08:45,639
Take them away and dispose of them.

128
00:08:46,879 --> 00:08:47,519
President,

129
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:49,240
they're Liuli's sisters after all.

130
00:08:49,559 --> 00:08:50,919
Leave their bodies intact.

131
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,200
Brother Li,

132
00:08:54,159 --> 00:08:56,279
they're of no use anymore.

133
00:09:01,159 --> 00:09:02,440
To achieve great things...

134
00:09:07,399 --> 00:09:09,799
Just like a woman from Minchun Pavilion.

135
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:13,240
What an exquisite figure.

136
00:09:13,559 --> 00:09:14,399
What are you doing?

137
00:09:14,679 --> 00:09:17,519
You've freeloaded in the Sanshan Gang.

138
00:09:17,799 --> 00:09:19,759
What's wrong with having a drink with me?

139
00:09:19,759 --> 00:09:21,799
I'll have a drink with you instead.

140
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:23,600
Miss!

141
00:09:23,879 --> 00:09:25,159
I was only joking.

142
00:09:25,519 --> 00:09:28,320
Not funny. She's a Sanshan Gang guest.

143
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:30,320
Watch your filthy mouth from now on.

144
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,240
Don't worry. As long as I'm here,

145
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,320
no one will dare touch you.

146
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,320
Thank you, Miss.

147
00:09:46,679 --> 00:09:48,240
Come find me if you ever need anything.

148
00:09:58,039 --> 00:09:59,720
Director Li, this way please.

149
00:10:07,039 --> 00:10:08,000
Right now,

150
00:10:09,279 --> 00:10:11,519
we're only two Coastal Defense Maps short.

151
00:10:12,399 --> 00:10:15,159
One is in Jiang Liuli's hands,

152
00:10:16,559 --> 00:10:17,519
and the other...

153
00:10:18,519 --> 00:10:20,919
is with Jin Mudan of the Sanshan Gang.

154
00:10:22,159 --> 00:10:24,320
Leave the remaining two to me.

155
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:28,519
I'll await your good news, Director Li.

156
00:10:49,879 --> 00:10:51,039
I'm with Chen Dieyi.

157
00:10:52,279 --> 00:10:53,279
I'll get you out of here.

158
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,399
As for those two maps...

159
00:10:56,799 --> 00:10:58,039
I'll leave them to you, Director Li.

160
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:00,879
Don't worry, President Sun.

161
00:11:01,639 --> 00:11:02,279
No need to see me out.

162
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:03,000
Take care.

163
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,200
President Sun,

164
00:11:12,759 --> 00:11:13,759
the Sanshan Gang

165
00:11:13,759 --> 00:11:15,080
still hasn't found Lian Ye's body.

166
00:11:15,399 --> 00:11:16,919
Our men haven't found it either.

167
00:11:28,159 --> 00:11:28,879
Don't worry.

168
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:31,399
Lian Ye will definitely rescue those two.

169
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,000
Where is your Coastal Defense Map hidden?

170
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:34,960
Can I take a look?

171
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:43,279
Keep it safe.

172
00:11:44,639 --> 00:11:45,279
Stop the car.

173
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:48,360
I'm heading to the Sanshan Gang.

174
00:11:49,279 --> 00:11:50,200
Take her back.

175
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:03,799
Please have a seat.

176
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,519
I'm a friend of Chen Dieyi.

177
00:12:14,879 --> 00:12:16,399
Could I borrow your Coastal Defense Map?

178
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,639
Until this is resolved,

179
00:12:32,279 --> 00:12:33,720
do not leave the Sanshan Gang.

180
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:53,480
Deputy Director Li,

181
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:55,200
our president made it clear:

182
00:12:55,559 --> 00:12:56,720
Hand over the Coastal Defense Map,

183
00:12:56,919 --> 00:12:57,759
and all will be forgiven.
